Feature: TC_14_STAFF - Free Text Commonage Evidence Query Letter E2E Regression Pack

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Legacy  : "Regression Pack for Free Text Commonage Evidence Query Letter" (BISSAGL-7518, AT-TC-01 and 02,
  #           tmslinks BISSAGL-14857 / 14856)
  # Rewritten 15-10-2026 in the StaffSteps vocabulary (the wording the MAPS features run with). One end-to-end
  # scenario; # SECTION markers show where each legacy scenario starts.
  #
  # Purpose:
  #   Staff can add free text to the BISS Commonage Evidence query letter and preview the letter, on a herd whose
  #   query letter has not started and on a herd whose admin check has not started.
  #
  # Test data:
  #   Herds come from the database, as in legacy ("Herds with Query Letter Not Started" and "Herds with Admin Check
  #   Not Started", scheme year 2024). Nothing is issued: the letter is only previewed, so the herds are not changed.
  #   Login agr4442 (BISS Co-ordination 1). Password: TD:Password from the TestData row of this test case.
  #
  # Step definitions: stepdefinitions.BISS.STAFF.StaffSteps (Correspondence and query letters)
  # Author: Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Background:
    Given the staff user is logged in to the BISS internal portal as "agr4442"

  @regression @staff @correspondence @query-letter @e2e
  Scenario: AT-STAFF-QUERY-LETTER-E2E-01 - Staff adds free text to the Commonage Evidence query letter and previews it

    # SECTION 1 : Herd with the query letter not started - AT-TC-01 (BISSAGL-14857)
    When the staff user opens the application for the next query-letter herd for scheme year "2024"
    And the staff user drafts a query letter with the following details
      | docType | BISS Commonage Evidence Letter |
      | comment | Test Comment                   |
    Then the query letter preview should be displayed

    # SECTION 2 : Herd with the admin check not started - AT-TC-02 (BISSAGL-14856)
    When the staff user opens the application for the next admin-check herd for scheme year "2024"
    And the staff user drafts a query letter with the following details
      | docType | BISS Commonage Evidence Letter |
      | comment | Test Comment                   |
    Then the query letter preview should be displayed
